Levi 3D Printables — license scope

Copyright (c) 2026 Levi / Cyberlevi, to the extent copyright applies.

License scope, except where a file states otherwise:
- fan-art/ is an explicit exception to the collection's Creative Commons license.
  It contains unofficial adaptations of third-party character or logo imagery.
  Only rights in Levi / Cyberlevi's own contributions are offered under the
  personal, noncommercial self-printing terms in fan-art/TERMS.md.
  No rights in the underlying third-party material are granted or claimed.
- models/ (including original geometry, model-specific Python design sources
  and renders), documentation, catalog and other collection content outside
  fan-art/ are licensed under
  Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International.
  Full text: licenses/CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0.txt
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/
  The existing license grants for the original BACKSTAGE lightning pick sign
  and long-neck dinosaur keyring remain unchanged. Third-party material is
  excluded from this grant, including imagery shown or referenced in documents.
- tools/ contains reusable software under the MIT license.
  Full text: licenses/MIT.txt

Third-party fonts and software retain their own licenses. No font binaries or
third-party library code are bundled. See docs/PROVENANCE.md.
The licenses grant only rights that the contributor is entitled to grant.
Nothing here restricts rights provided by GitHub's platform terms, applicable
statutory exceptions, or licenses already granted.
